            "unit": "USD"
          },
          {
            "name": "totalDue",
            "type": "number",
            "classification": "personal-financial",
            "description": "Final balance; zero when waived",
            "unit": "USD"
          },
          {
            "name": "note",
            "type": "string",
            "classification": "internal"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sourceAttribution": {
        "importedFrom": "https://github.com/makehaven/makehaven-website",
        "authoredBy": [
          "SchemaLattice makerspace deep-pass pilot"
        ],
        "sourceNotes": "storage_manager module: storage_violation ECK entity (field_storage_vi_assignment, field_storage_vi_active, field_storage_vi_start, field_storage_vi_resolved, field_storage_vi_daily, field_storage_vi_total, field_storage_vi_note) and its resolve flow (README: resolve stops charges while the member keeps the unit; blank total = accrued, 0 = waived). Kept as its own concept because it has its own lifecycle and charges and an assignment can have several."
      }
